<title>SPAIN: Telefonica starts promotion in Frankfurt Friday.</title>
<headline>Telefonica starts promotion in Frankfurt Friday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Espana will begin presentations to promote the international tranche of the sale of the state's remaining 20.9 percent stake in the firm in Frankfurt on Friday, a spokesman for the group said.</p>
<p>Chairman Juan Villalonga will attend the Frankfurt presentation, which will be followed next week by visits to Amsterdam and Rotterdam on Monday, Geneva and Zurich on Tuesday, London on Wednesday and Thursday and Edinburgh on Friday.</p>
<p>Following this, the team will fly to the U.S. and make a presentation in New York.</p>
<p>A separate team is promoting the shares in the Far East.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
